    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolver Lillies is a <strong>top-down looter shooter</strong> featuring fast-paced battles, randomly generated weapons, and comic book inspired pixel-art visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628650/extras/82175ae9abcd91cbadfcbfd89a99c16a.poster.avif?t=1751029090\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628650/extras/82175ae9abcd91cbadfcbfd89a99c16a.webm?t=1751029090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628650/extras/82175ae9abcd91cbadfcbfd89a99c16a.mp4?t=1751029090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Lily, a humble cowgirl, shooting and looting your way through a lawless frontier, bombing all the bad guys and <strong><i>banging</i></strong> all the\u00a0<strong><i>bad girls!</i></strong> Out here, violence is always the solution! Grab a gun and use your special abilities to liberate the cattlepunk west!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628650/extras/96ccefb4de796b0e5aaf231d736c9958.poster.avif?t=1751029090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628650/extras/96ccefb4de796b0e5aaf231d736c9958.webm?t=1751029090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -FEATURES- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUTA/INTERSEX:</strong> Lily is packing more than the average girl!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUNS GALORE:</strong> Dozens of random possible gun enchantments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION:</strong> Scrap your loot to make your own  guns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRONTIER NAVIGATION:</strong> An overworld map  with encounters!</p></li></ul>",
